  - X86_64:
    - FPU instructions: http://www.pmzone.org/appendixF.html
    - FPU tutorial: http://www.website.masmforum.com/tutorials/fptute/fpuchap10.htm
    - x86 reference: http://www.fermimn.gov.it/linux/quarta/x86/index.htm
    - SSE: http://softpixel.com/~cwright/programming/simd/sse.php
    - General information: file:/archive/optimizing_assembly.pdf
    - x86-64 ABI: file:/archive/x86-64-abi.pdf
  - MIPS
    - http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MIPS_instruction_set
    - Instructions, SPIM-desc. is better, though: http://www.mrc.uidaho.edu/mrc/people/jff/digital/MIPSir.html
    - Datasheet, somewhat compressed: file:/archive/4KcProgMan.pdf
    - ABI: file:/archive/mipsabi32.pdf
    - SPIM MIPS description: http://www.doc.ic.ac.uk/lab/secondyear/spim/node9.html
  - RA:
    http://pages.cs.wisc.edu/~cs701-1/NOTES/5.REGISTER-ALLOCATION.html
* Notes
** the write barrier can be disabled by defining DISABLE_WRITE_BARRIER
** enable GC logging with -DENABLE_GC_LOGGING
